# shell: desktop
# argv: none
# setup: deskbg
# AW-016: only when there is none yet.  This desktop already carries a
# record, put at 600,400 -- the boot install must leave it where it is.
wait 10
expect-pixel 620 420 10c810
note and nothing was installed at the golden-ratio place the default would
note have gone to
expect-pixel 640 620 336698
quit
